o cases that initially appear unrelated, but soon stakes his career – and life – on connecting the dots.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/1731c0ac-8f4e-4854-94cc-7155cdb3a600.webp"}}}},{"number":2,"title":"Kishi Kaisei","synopsis":"As crime boss Tozawa dangerously toes the line between territories, the rival Chihara-Kai scramble to collect dues. Samantha protects another hostess, while Jake witnesses a confrontation that changes everything.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/14868876-76f3-40c6-8492-a61af2897b3b.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"Kishi Kaisei","synopsis":"As crime boss Tozawa dangerously toes the line between territories, the rival Chihara-Kai scramble to collect dues. Samantha protects another hostess, while Jake witnesses a confrontation that changes everything.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/14868876-76f3-40c6-8492-a61af2897b3b.webp"}}}},{"number":3,"title":"Read the Air","synopsis":"Jake’s persistence pays off when he receives an exclusive from Detective Katagiri – but catches the less ideal eye of someone else in the process. Meanwhile, Samantha hits it off with a new customer, as Sato chooses between words and fists.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/eae230af-2f4b-434a-ae6b-e44a58cbf857.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"Read the Air","synopsis":"Jake’s persistence pays off when he receives an exclusive from Detective Katagiri – but catches the less ideal eye of someone else in the process. Meanwhile, Samantha hits it off with a new customer, as Sato chooses between words and fists.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/eae230af-2f4b-434a-ae6b-e44a58cbf857.webp"}}}},{"number":4,"title":"I Want It That Way","synopsis":"As Samantha makes strides toward the future, her past catches up. With help from Emi, Tin-Tin, and Trendy, Jake has a breakthrough in connecting the cases - and comes face-to-face with the head of Chihari-Kai, who requires a favor.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/b05fbdef-0324-4094-bc6d-03d969e35f9f.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"I Want It That Way","synopsis":"As Samantha makes strides toward the future, her past catches up. With help from Emi, Tin-Tin, and Trendy, Jake has a breakthrough in connecting the cases - and comes face-to-face with the head of Chihari-Kai, who requires a favor.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/b05fbdef-0324-4094-bc6d-03d969e35f9f.webp"}}}},{"number":5,"title":"Everybody Pays","synopsis":"When Jake helps reveal the mole in Chihara-Kai, he must weigh the risks of accepting a favor in return from Ishida. Samantha attempts to take care of her Matsuo problem. Sato’s recruitment ends with a devastating lesson in loyalty.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/1c2366e1-1782-4b8e-9ee6-e85408d2cb1e.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"Everybody Pays","synopsis":"When Jake helps reveal the mole in Chihara-Kai, he must weigh the risks of accepting a favor in return from Ishida. Samantha attempts to take care of her Matsuo problem. Sato’s recruitment ends with a devastating lesson in loyalty.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/1c2366e1-1782-4b8e-9ee6-e85408d2cb1e.webp"}}}},{"number":6,"title":"The Information Business","synopsis":"An impromptu Yakuza Peace Summit finds Tozawa at the mercy of his own actions. Samantha begins to settle her debts with Matsuo. A determined Jake chases down a tip from Ishida.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/3e38ed09-2774-41a4-a44c-627d5f9e780c.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"The Information Business","synopsis":"An impromptu Yakuza Peace Summit finds Tozawa at the mercy of his own actions. Samantha begins to settle her debts with Matsuo. A determined Jake chases down a tip from Ishida.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/3e38ed09-2774-41a4-a44c-627d5f9e780c.webp"}}}},{"number":7,"title":"Sometimes They Disappear","synopsis":"Jake struggles to regain his footing after the botched raid, while Samantha grows increasingly desperate to find Polina. Sato feels the pressure of his elevated standing in Chihari-Kai.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/f3dfdd4c-53a4-4885-8a48-1d0ae6d5de77.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"Sometimes They Disappear","synopsis":"Jake struggles to regain his footing after the botched raid, while Samantha grows increasingly desperate to find Polina. Sato feels the pressure of his elevated standing in Chihari-Kai.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/f3dfdd4c-53a4-4885-8a48-1d0ae6d5de77.webp"}}}},{"number":8,"title":"Yoshino","synopsis":"While Samantha risks it all for Polina’s safe return, Sato is forced to mix business with pleasure. As Katagiri devises a plan to finally take down Tozawa, Jake is confronted by the crime boss’s men.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/63d26230-7db7-4fbd-bbc1-6a420d980cc1.webp"},"metadataSources":{"streamingunity:5852":{"title":"Yoshino","synopsis":"While Samantha risks it all for Polina’s safe return, Sato is forced to mix business with pleasure. As Katagiri devises a plan to finally take down Tozawa, Jake is confronted by the crime boss’s men.","thumbnail":{"base":"streamingunity:images","path":"/images/63d26230-7db7-4fbd-bbc1-6a420d980cc1.webp"}}}}],"images":[]}],"provenance":{},"warnings":[],"enrichment":{"status":"pending"}}
